{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And a mist</b> — Twice in the Masorah: here and the other: ואד נכון לצלעו. A hint to what the Sages said: Why is his name called איד (Ed)? Because creatures break their heart so that the Holy One, blessed be He, will give them rain."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:40.786505352Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}